        <dc:description>&lt;p class="description"&gt;Svelok’s prowess impresses an affluent figure in the royal court, earning Lady Ivy an audience with the Grand Matriarch. This irritates Lady Gahya to no end and she begins plotting a way to take Svelok from Ivy, with force if necessary. Meanwhile on the surface, the devil turns his gaze to the Underhome…&lt;/p&gt;

